  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Integrating App Functionality**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating all components within `/src/App.tsx`. I\'m going to ensure the application state, specifically `tripData`, `alerts`, and `activeTab`, are managed correctly. I\'m leveraging `INITIAL_TRIP_DATA` and `MOCK_ALERTS` for initialization, ensuring a consistent starting point.\n\n\n**Defining App State and Handlers**\n\nI\'m currently working to solidify the application state within `/src/App.tsx`. I have defined states for each tab (\'timeline\', \'wallet\', \'alerts\', \'settings\'). I\'m also addressing modal triggers (`isAddTripOpen`, `isBoardingPassOpen`). Event handlers are in place for key interactions: `onTripGenerated` for updating `tripData` and adding notifications, `onUpdateName` to modify the passenger name, and `onMarkRead` to track alert status. Layout components are ready!\n\n\n"
