    modified_response: "I have built the **Kinetic Travel** application matching the design specifications and screens provided.\n\n### What Was Implemented\n\n- **Timeline View (Screen 1)**:\n  - **Header & Flight Status**: Profile picture, personalized greeting for Alex, and real-time flight badge (`Flight UA 421 \342\200\242 On Time`).\n  - **Upcoming Departure Hero Card**: Displays `SFO` \342\206\222 `JFK` flight details with airport codes and a countdown badge (`42 mins TO LEAVE`).\n  - **Smart Action Card**: Real-time travel prompt (\"Leave for SFO Terminal 2 now via Uber/Lyft...\") with quick-action pills for **Uber ($42 \342\200\242 28m)**, **TSA Pre (8 min)**, and **Transit (45 min)** that trigger real-time route estimates and wait times.\n  - **Today\'s Itinerary Timeline**: Chronological stepper line linking departure reminders, active terminal/gate focus nodes (`Terminal 2, Gate 54B`), weather updates, baggage drop deadlines, and boarding calls.\n\n- **Add Trip Details Modal (Screen 2)**:\n  - **Quick Import**: Textarea with clipboard paste support for flight numbers, confirmation emails, or train codes.\n  - **Connect Sources**: Quick-select pills for **Sync Google Calendar**, **Scan Boarding Pass PDF**, and **Scan Paper Ticket**.\n  - **AI Travel Timeline Extraction**: Powered by Gemini server-side AI (`/api/parse-trip`) to convert raw text into a travel schedule.\n\n- **Digital Boarding Pass & Companion Features**:\n  - **Interactive Boarding Pass**: High-contrast QR barcode, seat assignment (`12A`), gate, boarding group, and wallet save options.\n  - **Digital Wallet**: Manage stored boarding passes, TSA PreCheck credentials, and airline loyalty cards.\n  - **Flight Alerts**: Real-time notification feed for gate changes and security wait updates.\n  - **Settings**: Traveler profile and travel preferences management."
