  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have implemented an offline caching layer that saves trip itineraries and digital boarding pass details directly to `localStorage`:\n\n- **Client-Side Cache Utilities**: Created `/src/utils/storage.ts` to serialize and cache trip details, itinerary nodes, boarding pass data, flight alerts, and destination weather.\n- **Automatic Persistence & Rehydration**: Initialized application state from `localStorage` on boot and automatically synchronized trip updates or newly imported flights whenever changes occur.\n- **Destination Weather Caching**: Cached destination weather responses in `localStorage` so forecast details remain available when cellular signal or airport Wi-Fi is unavailable.\n- **Offline Network Detection**: Integrated `online`/`offline` window event listeners with a top status banner displaying connectivity status and offline readiness.\n- **Local Storage Management**: Added an **Offline Storage & Local Cache** section in Settings showing real-time cache sync timestamps and a cache reset option."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
